          "id": 2217139142,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Marking as a draft for now. If you're on Windows and the text files in your local working directory have CRLF line endings, this will convert each file that you edit to LF, which will result in a mix of CRLF and LF files. I'm not sure if that's desired.",
